:371640,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-371640-1847286114032154","game_id":"steam-371640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo updated: a reworked interface","summary":"Hi all, A new demo build is live, and the playtest build has it too. I've reworked the whole interface, so every screen should be cleaner, easier to read and easier to use, on PC and Steam Deck. It was a big change, so if anything looks wrong or a button doesn't respond, please tell me on the Discord, ideally with a screenshot: https://discord.com/invite/5dJ4jXQy8P Thank you for playing. Nico","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T10:56:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032154","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:53:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-371640-1847286114030406","game_id":"steam-371640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo updated: fairer scavenging, and choices that come back round","summary":"Hi all, If you haven't come across Mercyrail yet: Britain fell a year ago, and you're running the last train out of Waterloo, heading north across the real UK rail network towards a rumoured place called Haven. You decide who gets a seat, send your crew into empty towns for supplies, and try to keep everyone alive along the way. The demo is free, and it's part of Steam Next Fest until 26 October. I make the game on my own, and the people playing it this week have spotted things I'd stopped being","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:37:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030406","verified_at":"2026-10-21T21:38:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-371640-1846651706692141","game_id":"steam-371640","kind":"announcement","title":"Mercyrail is in Steam Next Fest, come and tell me what you think","summary":"Hi all, Mercyrail: Haven Bound is part of Steam Next Fest, which runs from 19 to 26 October. The demo is free and you can play it right now. If you haven't come across it yet: Britain fell a year ago. You're running the last train out of a dark Waterloo, heading north across the real UK rail network towards a rumoured colony called Haven. You decide who gets a place, send your crew into empty towns for supplies, and try to keep everyone alive long enough to get there. I'm making this on my own, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:24:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-371640-1845383656384269","game_id":"steam-371640","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo now available!","summary":"Hi everyone!I'm excited to announce that the demo for Mercyrail: Haven Bound is now available.Wishlist the game or try the demoIt's a limited demo to give you a taste of what's to come, so I hope you enjoy it.Got thoughts on the demo / game? Why not join our Discord:https://discord.gg/QrGqTTqezR","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T22:42:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:00:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-371640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T23:57:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T23:57:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-